endue.formats RAR reader (lib/rar)

This reader was written for endue Desk from published descriptions of the RAR formats and from
permissively licensed readers of them. No code was taken or followed from unRAR or from any other
source under the unRAR licence restriction, the GPL or the LGPL. ADR 0051 records how it was made.

Sources followed

* RAR 5.0 archive format (technote), RARLAB, https://www.rarlab.com/technote.htm: the RAR 5 block
  and header layout, vints, extra records, compression information and dictionary sizes.

* libarchive, archive_read_support_format_rar5.c and archive_read_support_format_rar.c,
  https://github.com/libarchive/libarchive, used under the BSD 2-clause licence below: the RAR 5 and
  RAR 2.9 compressed block layouts, Huffman tables, match decoding and filters (RAR 5's delta, E8,
  E8E9 and ARM; RAR 3's standard VM filters recognised by their code's CRC: E8, E8E9, delta, RGB,
  audio).

