* PPMd variant H (rar4/ppmd*.js): after Dmitry Shkarin's PPMd var.H (2001) and the carryless range
  coder by Dmitry Subbotin (1999), both in the public domain, as Igor Pavlov's LZMA SDK (Ppmd7,
  public domain) and libarchive's archive_ppmd7.c (public domain) implement them.

* Behaviour that none of these describes (how a solid RAR 4 stream carries on from file to file, the
  PPMd escape symbol of a continued model) was found by decoding archives that RARLAB's rar wrote.

